+// Precise-model gate for the transparent-overlay fast path: TB323FU
+// (SM8850P) may skip the expensive CTM/shaper/3D-LUT work for fully
+// transparent black overlay pixels. The device id env var is fixed for the
+// lifetime of the process, so the result is cached once.
